      "In-process network: clients, provers and the EVM share one Node process.",
      "In-process EDR guard (EDR_GUARD=1, see installEdrGuard): nonce queries, gas estimates and calls use the \"latest\" block instead of \"pending\" (4882 queries retagged; each sender has at most one transaction in flight, so the nonce is the same), eth_estimateGas and eth_call run one at a time (0 + 9), and a full GC runs every second. EDR allocator: MIMALLOC_PURGE_DELAY=0."
